There is a difference. In the Sanctum you can fight the
dangerous priests at choke points. At Astral you wouldn't
want to wait at the door for the Riders to resurrect and
approach. Also fighting the Wizard is not comparable; you
shouldn't melee the Wizard, rather insta-kill him with a
wand of death (or if available, a rubber chicken). But
typically you neither have enough charges for all the @'s
at the Sanctum (you wand to save the charged anyway for
Famine and Pestilence), and you can't be sure that those
Astral critters aren't immune to death or have reflection.

> 
