> Conflict is widely considered desirable in the late game,

Indeed. It will lead to a situation where the surrounding
monsters will, for one, just ignore you mostly, and second,
they will kill (or at least weaken) each other for you.
Conflict is priceless, specifically on Air and Astral.

> although personally I tend to prefer to spend my ring slots
