Bad choices. The first two are at that stage unnecessary.
And instead of using one of the two precious ring slots
for levitation all you need is just a single blessed potion
of levitation to be used when entering the Plane of Air,
and continue using it on Fire - some folks "levitate" also
through the Plane of Water -, and as soon as you arrive at
Astral you just type '>' to softly land.

> 
