The powerful melee capabilities are helpful for the Riders;
two hits can often kill them. But two hits may require too
much time, as also experienced by the OP, WRT their special
attack series. While melee can be helpful against the Riders,
specifically if you weakened them by one or two attacks from
distance, melee is not a good tactics for all the @'s and A's.
Teleporting them away and jumping is one most effective key.

